Inkling agent runtime (@studio/agent)

This package includes code adapted from @daytona/pi 0.191.2
(https://github.com/daytonaio/daytona, libs/pi), the official pi integration for Daytona:

  src/sandbox/ops.ts       (from src/ops.ts)
  src/sandbox/exec.ts      (from src/sandbox.ts, src/ops.ts, src/util.ts)
  src/sandbox/search.ts    (from src/grep-tool.ts, src/find-tool.ts)
  src/tools/sandbox.ts     (tool wrapping, from src/tools.ts)

