Modifications: per-session sandboxes instead of one global sandbox (no CLI flags), lazy
acquisition through a session manager, background-safe and streaming exec, ripgrep with a grep/find
fallback, Inkling-specific tools (run_python, preview_url, export_artifact, upload_dataset_sample).
